%%{init: {"sequence": {"mirrorActors": false, "messageMargin": 16, "actorMargin": 30, "boxMargin": 6, "noteMargin": 6, "width": 110}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
    actor U as Bibliophile
    participant UI as Screens
    participant S as Service
    participant L as IsbnLookup
    participant R as BookRepository
    U->>UI: scan ISBN
    UI->>S: LookupIsbnUseCase<br/>.execute(isbn)
    S->>S: Isbn.parse(isbn)
    Note right of S: a typo stops here<br/>(InvalidIsbnError)
    S->>L: byIsbn(isbn)
    Note right of L: Google Books +<br/>Open Library,<br/>merged, cached
    L-->>S: BookMetadata
    S-->>UI: details + covers
    U->>UI: cover, binding,<br/>shelf, read status
    UI->>S: ScanBookUseCase<br/>.execute(ownerId, isbn, ...)
    S->>R: loadLibrary(ownerId)
    R-->>S: PersonalLibrary
    alt ISBN already in library
        S->>S: book.addCopy()
        Note right of S: duplicate ISBN =<br/>one more copy
    else new ISBN
        S->>L: byIsbn(isbn)
        L-->>S: BookMetadata
        S->>S: library.addBook(book)
    end
    S->>R: save(ownerId, book)
    R-->>S: Book
    S-->>UI: Book
    UI-->>U: shown on its shelf
